EX-J22 DC kBest clustering at effort >= 7 (2026-05-28)
======================================================

Change: jxl-encoder/src/jpeg/encode.rs line 785, the entropy code build
for the combined DC + AC-metadata token stream now uses
enhanced_clustering = (effort >= 7), matching the AC code path (line ~919)
which has used the same gate since dddebe2c.

Previously the DC code clustering was hardcoded to false (kFast) per
"lever #3 (2026-05-28) match libjxl JPEG transcode path which sets
uint_method = kNone for non-modular paths". The comment was about
uint_method, not the clustering primitive — they're independent levers.

Env hook: JPEG_DC_NO_CLUSTERING=1 forces kFast on the DC code for A/B.

